<item>
  <title>Beyond Morality: Nietzsche’s Non-Prescriptive Project</title>
  <link>https://camilosalgar.github.io/essays/essays/nietzsche-beyond-morality.html</link>
  <description><![CDATA[ 




<p><em>Directed Studies, Historical and Political Thought, Prof.&nbsp;Christopher McGowan, Spring 2026</em></p>
<p>Argues that the Genealogy of Morals calls morality itself into question rather than prescribing master morality, reading Nietzsche’s perspectivism as a method that ends in productive uncertainty.</p>
