<item>
  <title>Aesthetic Transcendence: Tolstoy’s Meaning Beyond Particularity</title>
  <link>https://camilosalgar.github.io/essays/essays/tolstoy-aesthetic-transcendence.html</link>
  <description><![CDATA[ 




<p><em>Directed Studies, Literature, Prof.&nbsp;Serena Bassi, Spring 2026</em></p>
<p>Reads the thistle of Hadji Murat’s prologue against the hero’s death to show how Tolstoy’s aesthetics carry the historical story beyond its particulars toward a meaning death cannot confine.</p>
