<item>
  <title>Questioning Hegel: Master-Slave Dialectic in Motion</title>
  <link>https://camilosalgar.github.io/essays/essays/hegel-master-slave-dialectic.html</link>
  <description><![CDATA[ 




<p><em>Directed Studies, Philosophy, Prof.&nbsp;Tamar Gendler, Spring 2026</em></p>
<p>Reconstructs Hegel’s account of self-consciousness through recognition and asks why the master-slave dialectic stops where it does, and whether the slave’s independence through labor contradicts it.</p>
